SUMMARY:AT -From Sam's Gap South  FITNESS HIKE
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThe Hike will start at the Sam's G
 ap parking lot. We will hike south on the AT for 5.75 miles to a view poin
 t. Snack there\, then return. (11.5 miles out and back\, approx. 2650 ft. 
 elevation gain) the weather is looking fairly good at this point but maybe
  bring a raincoat just in case there is a shower.\nI will post any cancell
 ation by 7:15 AM\n\n**Pace:** We will hike at a brisk pace averaging appro
 ximately 2 1/2 -3 mph adjusting for steepness of grade and rugged trail co
 nditions. Please be comfortable with this distance\, elevation and pace.\n
 **Dogs\; F**riendly dogs ok.\n\n**Car Pool or Follow to the trailhead.** T
 o Carpool\, meet at the Park and Ride lot off Exit 17 on I-26 W at 8:30 am
 . Please post if you plan to meet us there otherwise we will see U at the 
 trailhead at 8:50 am.\n\n**Hike Levels:** Level (1) Up to 600 feet\; Level
  (2) 600'- 900'\; Level (3) 900' - 1200'\; Level (4) 1200' - 1500'\; Level
  (5) 1\,500' - 1\,800'\; Level (6) 1\,800' - 2\,100'\; Level (7) 2\,100' -
  2\,400'\; Level (8) 2\,400' - 2700'\; Level (9) 2700' - 3000' Level (10) 
 3000' - 4000'\; Ultimate Hikes are > 4\,000'.\n**Hike Cancellation:** IF Y
 OU SIGN ON THIS HIKE AND CHANGE YOU MIND (EVEN IF ON THE WAITLIST) GO BACK
  TO THE RSVP LINK AND CHANGE YOUR HIKE STATUS TO FREE UP YOUR RESERVED SPO
 T.\n**Release of Liability:**\nThe organizer of this trip is a volunteer a
 nd not a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to orga
 nize this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowledg
 e that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, 
 illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated wit
 h this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup t
 erms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315839893
 /
